  /// General Reference .
  pub components: List[ComponentConfiguration]? = None
  /// The base image for customizations specified in the image recipe. You can
  /// specify the parent image using one of the following options: AMI ID
  /// Image Builder image Amazon Resource Name (ARN) Amazon Web Services
  /// Systems Manager (SSM) Parameter Store Parameter, prefixed by ssm: ,
  /// followed by the parameter name or ARN. Amazon Web Services Marketplace
