  /// EXPRESSION_MATCH_AND_DEPENDENCY_UPDATES_AVAILABLE (default) – When you
  /// use semantic version filters on the base image or components in your
  /// image recipe, EC2 Image Builder builds a new image only when there are
  /// new versions of the base image or components in your recipe that match
  /// the filter. For semantic version syntax, see CreateComponent .
  /// EXPRESSION_MATCH_ONLY – This condition builds a new image every time
